  "body": "Neither WindowProxy nor Location define [[HasProperty]].  Presumably the intent is that they use https://tc39.github.io/ecma262/#sec-ordinary-object-internal-methods-and-internal-slots-hasproperty-p but it would be good to make that explicit.  Probably best to say that they use the ordinary object internal methods except as stated otherwise.",
